OL,3,GNEWSAPassports needed for ferry
OL,4,Apassengers travelling between UK and
OL,5,AIreland
OL,6,
OL,7,FPreviously, passengers were able to use
OL,8,Fother forms of ID, such as driving
OL,9,Flicences and national identity cards -
OL,10,Fbut the changes are being brought in to
OL,11,Fcomply with UK Border Force rules.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
